# Failures listing or deleting a machine's named Herdr sessions.

error-client-sessions-delete-default = 无法删除默认会话
# $status is how the herdr command exited, in the system's words.
error-client-sessions-delete-failed = Herdr 拒绝删除会话（{ $status }）；会话可能正在运行、无法访问，或已安装的 CLI 不支持此操作
error-client-sessions-delete-timeout = 删除会话超时；请刷新列表后重试
error-client-sessions-limit = 会话过多，无法列出
